 style=\"color:#000\"> </span><span style=\"color:#066\">1</span><span style=\"color:#660\">:</span><span style=\"color:#000\">N</span><span style=\"color:#660\">){</span><span style=\"color:#000\"><br> </span><span style=\"color:#008\">for</span><span style=\"color:#660\">(</span><span style=\"color:#000\">j </span><span style=\"color:#008\">in</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> </span><span style=\"color:#066\">1</span><span style=\"color:#660\">:</span><span style=\"color:#000\">C</span><span style=\"color:#660\">){</span><span style=\"color:#000\"><br> increment_log_prob</span><span style=\"color:#660\">(</span><span style=\"color:#000\"><br> pi</span><span style=\"color:#660\">[</span><span style=\"color:#000\">j</span><span style=\"color:#660\">]+</span><span style=\"color:#000\">normal_log</span><span style=\"color:#660\">(</span><span style=\"color:#000\">v</span><span style=\"color:#660\">[</span><span style=\"color:#000\">i</span><span style=\"color:#660\">],</span><span style=\"color:#000\">mu_mix</span><span style=\"color:#660\">[</span><span style=\"color:#000\">j</span><span style=\"color:#660\">],</span><span style=\"color:#000\">tau_mix</span><span style=\"color:#660\">[</span><span style=\"color:#000\">j</span><span style=\"color:#660\">])</span><span style=\"color:#000\"><br> </span><span style=\"color:#660\">);</span><span style=\"color:#000\"><br> </span><span style=\"color:#660\">}</span><span style=\"color:#000\"><br> </span><span style=\"color:#660\">}</span><span style=\"color:#000\"><br> <br> </span><span style=\"color:#660\">}</span><span style=\"color:#000\"><br><br></span></div></code></div><div style=\"box-sizing:border-box\"><br><pre style=\"box-sizing:border-box;font-family:Consolas,&#39;Liberation Mono&#39;,Menlo,Courier,monospace;width:748px\"><div style=\"border:1px solid rgb(187,187,187);word-wrap:break-word;background-color:rgb(250,250,250)\"><code><div><span style=\"color:#800\">#from BUGS book page 293</span><span style=\"color:#000\"><br></span><span style=\"color:#800\">#Stick-breaking process</span><span style=\"color:#000\"><br></span><span style=\"color:#800\">#<a href=\"http://www2.imm.dtu.dk/courses/02443/projects/Roeder_JASA_1990.pdf\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=http://www2.imm.dtu.dk/courses/02443/projects/Roeder_JASA_1990.pdf&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1792466025015000&amp;usg=AOvVaw02fcz528LnG5Y4xfTGCBJ3\">http://www2.imm.dtu.dk/courses/02443/projects/Roeder_JASA_1990.pdf</a></span><span style=\"color:#000\"><br>library</span><span style=\"color:#660\">(</span><span style=\"color:#000\">rstan</span><span style=\"color:#660\">)</span><span style=\"color:#000\"><br> <br>C </span><span style=\"color:#660\">&lt;-</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> </span><span style=\"color:#066\">10</span><span style=\"color:#000\"><br>data </span><span style=\"color:#660\">&lt;-</span><span style=\"color:#000\">read</span><span style=\"color:#660\">.</span><span style=\"color:#000\">csv</span><span style=\"color:#660\">(</span><span style=\"color:#080\">&quot;data.csv&quot;</span><span style=\"color:#660\">)</span><span style=\"color:#000\"><br>N </span><span style=\"color:#660\">&lt;-</span><span style=\"color:#000\">nrow</span><span style=\"color:#660\">(</span><span style=\"color:#000\">data</span><span style=\"color:#660\">)</span><span style=\"color:#000\"><br> <br>model </span><span style=\"color:#660\">&lt;-</span><span style=\"color:#000\">stan_model</span><span style=\"color:#660\">(</span><span style=\"color:#080\">&quot;STB.stan&quot;</span><span style=\"color:#660\">)</span><span style=\"color:#000\"><br>fit </span><span style=\"color:#660\">&lt;-</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> sampling</span><span style=\"color:#660\">(</span><span style=\"color:#000\">model</span><span style=\"color:#660\">,</span><span style=\"color:#000\">v</span><span style=\"color:#660\">=</span><span style=\"color:#000\">data</span><span style=\"color:#660\">,</span><span style=\"color:#000\">N</span><span style=\"color:#660\">=</span><span style=\"color:#000\">N</span><span style=\"color:#660\">,</span><span style=\"color:#000\">C</span><span style=\"color:#660\">=</span><span style=\"color:#000\">C</span><span style=\"color:#660\">,</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> iter </span><span style=\"color:#660\">=</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> </span><span style=\"color:#066\">1000</span><span style=\"color:#660\">,</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> chains </span><span style=\"color:#660\">=</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> </span><span style=\"color:#066\">1</span><span style=\"color:#660\">)</span><span style=\"color:#000\"><br> <br>traceplot</span><span style=\"color:#660\">(</span><span style=\"color:#000\">fit</span><span style=\"color:#660\">,</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> ask</span><span style=\"color:#660\">=</span><span style=\"color:#000\">T</span><span style=\"color:#660\">)</span><span style=\"color:#000\"><br></span><span style=\"color:#008\">print</span><span style=\"color:#660\">(</span><span style=\"color:#000\">fit</span><span style=\"color:#660\">,</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> digit</span><span style=\"color:#660\">=</span><span style=\"color:#066\">2</span><span style=\"color:#660\">)</span></div></code></div><div style=\"box-sizing:border-box\"><span style=\"box-sizing:border-box\"><br></span></div></pre></div></pre></div><div><br></div><div><a href=\"https://gist.github.com/xiangze/4c3c54d73bc7668ad139\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=https://gist.github.com/xiangze/4c3c54d73bc7668ad139&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1792466025015000&amp;usg=AOvVaw3YQ3FEhmUXPX_JDsIZqj44\">https://gist.github.com/xiangze/4c3c54d73bc7668ad139</a><br></div><div><br></div><div><br></div><div>The compile process of this code seems successfully done. But the sampling process stopped with the following messages.</div><div><br></div><div><blockquote style=\"margin:0px 0px 0px 0.8ex;border-left-width:1px;border-left-color:rgb(204,204,204);border-left-style:solid;padding-left:1ex\" class=\"gmail_quote\">Invalid value of pi: <a href=\"http://d.hatena.ne.jp/keyword/Error\" style=\"color:rgb(69,69,69);word-wrap:break-word;border-bottom-width:1px;border-bottom-style:solid;border-bottom-color:rgb(222,222,222)\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=http://d.hatena.ne.jp/keyword/Error&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1792466025015000&amp;usg=AOvVaw3CxLB4P2TYl0hAawBsQsf1\">Error</a> in function validate transformed params N4stan5agrad3varE: pi<br>pi is not a valid simplex. The element at 5 is -0.719628:0, but should be greater than or equal to 0<br>Rejecting proposed initial value with zero density.<br>Initialization failed after 100 attempts. Try specifying initial values, reducing ranges of constrained values, or reparameterizing the model.<br><a href=\"http://d.hatena.ne.jp/keyword/error\" style=\"color:rgb(69,69,69);word-wrap:break-word;border-bottom-width:1px;border-bottom-style:solid;border-bottom-color:rgb(222,222,222)\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=http://d.hatena.ne.jp/keyword/error&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1792466025015000&amp;usg=AOvVaw3uFENedcz9drU2doTbBY32\">error</a> occurred during calling the sampler; sampling not done</blockquote><p style=\"margin-bottom:0px;color:rgb(69,69,69);font-family:&#39;Trebuchet MS&#39;,Arial,Helvetica,&#39;\\0030d2\\0030e9\\0030ae\\0030ce\\0089d2\\0030b4  Pro W3&#39;,&#39;Hiragino Kaku Gothic Pro&#39;,メイリオ,Meiryo,&#39;\\00ff2d\\00ff33  \\00ff30\\0030b4\\0030b7\\0030c3\\0030af&#39;,&#39;MS PGothic&#39;,sans-serif;font-size:14px;line-height:26.600000381469727px\"><br></p><p style=\"margin-bottom:0px;color:rgb(69,69,69);font-family:&#39;Trebuchet MS&#39;,Arial,Helvetica,&#39;\\0030d2\\0030e9\\0030ae\\0030ce\\0089d2\\0030b4  Pro W3&#39;,&#39;Hiragino Kaku Gothic Pro&#39;,メイリオ,Meiryo,&#39;\\00ff2d\\00ff33  \\00ff30\\0030b4\\0030b7\\0030c3\\0030af&#39;,&#39;MS PGothic&#39;,sans-serif;font-size:14px;line-height:26.600000381469727px\">Is this error caused by insufficient <span style=\"font-size:13px;line-height:18px\">coding </span><span style=\"font-size:13px;line-height:18px\">or internal restriction of stan?</span></p><p style=\"margin-bottom:0px;color:rgb(69,69,69);font-family:&#39;Trebuchet MS&#39;,Arial,Helvetica,&#39;\\0030d2\\0030e9\\0030ae\\0030ce\\0089d2\\0030b4  Pro W3&#39;,&#39;Hiragino Kaku Gothic Pro&#39;,メイリオ,Meiryo,&#39;\\00ff2d\\00ff33  \\00ff30\\0030b4\\0030b7\\0030c3\\0030af&#39;,&#39;MS PGothic&#39;,sans-serif;font-size:14px;line-height:26.600000381469727px\"><span style=\"font-size:13px;line-height:18px\"><br></span></p><p style=\"margin-bottom:0px;color:rgb(69,69,69);font-family:&#39;Trebuchet MS&#39;,Arial,Helvetica,&#39;\\0030d2\\0030e9\\0030ae\\0030ce\\0089d2\\0030b4  Pro W3&#39;,&#39;Hiragino Kaku Gothic Pro&#39;,メイリオ,Meiryo,&#39;\\00ff2d\\00ff33  \\00ff30\\0030b4\\0030b7\\0030c3\\0030af&#39;,&#39;MS PGothic&#39;,sans-serif;font-size:14px;line-height:26.600000381469727px\"><span style=\"font-size:13px;line-height:18px\">Regards,</span></p><p style=\"margin-bottom:0px;color:rgb(69,69,69);font-family:&#39;Trebuchet MS&#39;,Arial,Helvetica,&#39;\\0030d2\\0030e9\\0030ae\\0030ce\\0089d2\\0030b4  Pro W3&#39;,&#39;Hiragino Kaku Gothic Pro&#39;,メイリオ,Meiryo,&#39;\\00ff2d\\00ff33  \\00ff30\\0030b4\\0030b7\\0030c3\\0030af&#39;,&#39;MS PGothic&#39;,sans-serif;font-size:14px;line-height:26.600000381469727px\"><span style=\"font-size:13px;line-height:18px\">Xiangze</span><br></p><p style=\"margin-bottom:0px;color:rgb(69,69,69);font-family:&#39;Trebuchet MS&#39;,Arial,Helvetica,&#39;\\0030d2\\0030e9\\0030ae\\0030ce\\0089d2\\0030b4  Pro W3&#39;,&#39;Hiragino Kaku Gothic Pro&#39;,メイリオ,Meiryo,&#39;\\00ff2d\\00ff33  \\00ff30\\0030b4\\0030b7\\0030c3\\0030af&#39;,&#39;MS PGothic&#39;,sans-serif;font-size