     1,
     "<div dir=\"ltr\"><div><br>Both, since Stan needs to know the support of the parameters (which can be unbounded on one or both sides). At a minimum, you would need to change inside the parameters block to:<br><br><div style=\"background-color:rgb(250,250,250);border-color:rgb(187,187,187);border-style:solid;border-width:1px;word-wrap:break-word\"><code><div><span style=\"color:#000\">vector</span><span style=\"color:#660\">&lt;</span><span style=\"color:#000\">lower</span><span style=\"color:#660\">=</span><span style=\"color:#066\">0</span><span style=\"color:#660\">&gt;[</span><span style=\"color:#000\">C</span><span style=\"color:#660\">]</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> tau_mix</span><span style=\"color:#660\">;</span><span style=\"color:#000\"><br>real</span><span style=\"color:#660\">&lt;</span><span style=\"color:#000\">lower</span><span style=\"color:#660\">=</span><span style=\"color:#066\">0</span><span style=\"color:#660\">,</span><span style=\"color:#000\">upper</span><span style=\"color:#660\">=</span><span style=\"color:#066\">1</span><span style=\"color:#660\">&gt;</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> q</span><span style=\"color:#660\">[</span><span style=\"color:#000\">N</span><span style=\"color:#660\">];</span><span style=\"color:#000\"><br></span></div></code></div><br>I&#39;m not sure if that is sufficient.<br><br>Ben<br><br></div></div>"
    ]
   ]
  },
  {
   "id": "s5sN5YgMaqwJ",
