    [
     1,
     "<div style=\"word-wrap:break-word\">Why are you trying to implement stick-breaking by yourself?  Stan’s simplex<div>data type implements an efficient stick-breaking already.<br><div><br><div></div></div></div></div>"
    ],
    [
     3,
     "<div style=\"word-wrap:break-word\"><div><div><div><div>On Aug 16, 2014, at 8:34 PM, Ben Goodrich &lt;<a href data-email-masked rel=\"nofollow\">goodri...@gmail.com</a>&gt; wrote:</div><br></div></div></div></div>"
    ],
    [
     3,
     "<div style=\"word-wrap:break-word\"><div><div><div><blockquote type=\"cite\"><div dir=\"ltr\">On Saturday, August 16, 2014 7:02:11 AM UTC-4, Xiangze Dubian wrote:<blockquote class=\"gmail_quote\" style=\"margin:0;margin-left:0.8ex;border-left:1px #ccc solid;padding-left:1ex\"><p style=\"margin-bottom:0px;color:rgb(69,69,69);font-family:&#39;Trebuchet MS&#39;,Arial,Helvetica,&#39;\\0030d2\\0030e9\\0030ae\\0030ce\\0089d2\\0030b4Pro W3&#39;,&#39;Hiragino Kaku Gothic Pro&#39;,メイリオ,Meiryo,&#39;\\00ff2d\\00ff33\\00ff30\\0030b4\\0030b7\\0030c3\\0030af&#39;,&#39;MS PGothic&#39;,sans-serif;font-size:14px;line-height:26.600000381469727px\">Is this error caused by insufficient <span style=\"font-size:13px;line-height:18px\">coding </span><span style=\"font-size:13px;line-height:18px\">or internal restriction of stan?</span></p></blockquote><div><br>Both, since Stan needs to know the support of the parameters (which can be unbounded on one or both sides). At a minimum, you would need to change inside the parameters block to:<br><br><div style=\"background-color:rgb(250,250,250);border-color:rgb(187,187,187);border-style:solid;border-width:1px;word-wrap:break-word\"><code>vector<span style=\"color:#660\">&lt;</span>lower<span style=\"color:#660\">=</span><span style=\"color:#066\">0</span><span style=\"color:#660\">&gt;[</span>C<span style=\"color:#660\">]</span> tau_mix<span style=\"color:#660\">;</span><br>real<span style=\"color:#660\">&lt;</span>lower<span style=\"color:#660\">=</span><span style=\"color:#066\">0</span><span style=\"color:#660\">,</span>upper<span style=\"color:#660\">=</span><span style=\"color:#066\">1</span><span style=\"color:#660\">&gt;</span> q<span style=\"color:#660\">[</span>N<span style=\"color:#660\">];</span><br></code></div><br>I&#39;m not sure if that is sufficient.<br><br>Ben<br><br></div></div><div><br></div></blockquote></div></div></div></div>"
    ],
